{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2024-06", "window": 4, "start_date": 1719100800, "end_date": 1719791999, "month_true_total": 2147, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:06:31 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "168648599", "author": {"steamid": "76561198416730567", "personaname": "P0S13D0N", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198416730567/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3758, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3314, "last_played": 1777068354, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Played this game for a few years primarily on Xbox. I was able to transfer my data from the Xbox to PC. Id recommend it to anyone who likes a game with a story line and open world game play. Its not a pay to play game, so if you don't like those kind of games. give this a shot. It does have options to pay for items and dlc content if you wanted too. With a lot of time grinding in this game you can pretty much unlock all the weapons and characters with blueprints available in the game. A lot of the story in the game or side missions can assist you with unlocking items.", "timestamp_created": 1719791750, "timestamp_updated": 1719791960, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168645615", "author": {"steamid": "76561199121909082", "personaname": "Dystopia", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199121909082/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 50191, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 10, "playtime_at_review": 14128, "last_played": 1789353849, "avatar": "11d19f165150dca602dac92a6479e6840dd56cf8"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've played this game for a bit, and I have recently reached MR 15. After that my interest in the game started to decline and i slowly stopped playing over the last few months. But I saw the new update so i decided to give it another try. I've loved it! \r\n\r\nThese quality of life changes have made the game so much more enjoyable and made me to be able to introduce my friends to the game as well. I hope they keep adding small changes like this that make the game more enjoyable for new players!", "timestamp_created": 1719788503, "timestamp_updated": 1719788503, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168645367", "author": {"steamid": "76561199096399127", "personaname": "Super Pvt. Supertard", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199096399127/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 107195, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 74950, "last_played": 1760901364, "avatar": "5364a10a7cfe467d63c891b56b23ae1869e285f5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pros: It's not Destiny\r\n\r\nCons: It didn't completely kill Destiny.\r\n\r\nExtra Pros: All my homies love this and hate Destiny.", "timestamp_created": 1719788267, "timestamp_updated": 1719788267, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168644585", "author": {"steamid": "7656119910957691